qa-gate vendors libarchive-wasm 1.2.0 for reading RAR/7z/ZIP archives.

Upstream projects:
- libarchive-wasm 1.2.0 (MIT), https://github.com/ofk/libarchive-wasm
  Copyright (c) ofk contributors
- libarchive (BSD-2-Clause), https://github.com/libarchive/libarchive
  Copyright (c) 2003-2018 Tim Kientzle and contributors

The bundled `libarchive.wasm` is an Emscripten build of libarchive produced by
the libarchive-wasm project. The JavaScript files under this directory are the
unmodified published `dist/` output of libarchive-wasm 1.2.0.

License texts follow in LICENSE.

This directory is vendored at build time. qa-gate does not download or execute
external binaries at runtime.
